# Cross-Repo Layout

Workspace hien co 3 repo:

| Repo | Path | Vai tro |
|---|---|---|
| flash-sale-b2c-UTC2 | d:\flash-sale-b2c-UTC2 | Spring Boot backend (repo nay) |
| flash-sale-b2c | d:\flash-sale-b2c | Next.js frontend (consume API backend) |
| deploy-b2c-utc2 | d:\deploy-b2c-utc2 | Docker compose, nginx, scripts deploy (multi-service orchestration) |

## Quy tac

- Repo nay **chi chua** backend Java + config + SQL + lua script.
- KHONG sua code frontend trong repo backend.
- KHONG commit docker-compose / nginx vao repo backend (da co repo deploy).
- File .env quan ly rieng o repo deploy.
- Neu can thay doi API contract -> sua docs/api/api-document.md (sau khi user duyet) + bao team frontend.

## Deploy repo (deploy-b2c-utc2)

Cac file dang chu y:

- docker-compose.yml - orchestrate backend, frontend, postgres, redis, nginx.
- docker/backend.Dockerfile - build image backend.
- docker/frontend.Dockerfile - build image frontend.
- nginx/default.conf - reverse proxy /api -> backend, / -> frontend, /ws -> backend WS.
- scripts/check-health.sh - health check sau deploy.
- scripts/deploy.sh - entry point deploy.

## Backend source code layout (nho)

- src/main/java/com/b2c/flash_sale_b2c_UTC2/ - source code.
- src/main/resources/db/migration/ - Flyway SQL.
- src/main/resources/lua/ - Redis Lua scripts.
- src/main/resources/application.yaml - config chinh.
- src/main/resources/application-local.yaml.example - template env vars.
- src/test/ - test code.
- .cursor/rules/ - Cursor rules (rule cua agent).

## Khi code Backend

- Import path: com.b2c.flash_sale_b2c_UTC2.<module>.<layer>.<Class>.
- Khi tao feature moi, tham chieu project-structure.mdc de xac dinh module + layer.
- Khi thay doi API contract, xem response-format.mdc + endpoints-*.mdc.